      "value": "<p>A full-frame reconstruction in featherlight alloys so responsive the weapon barely registers in the hand, freeing the wearer's focus for split-second power use. Originally developed for Salarian STG agents who weave gunfire and tech in the same breath.</p><p>Once per turn, you may activate a biotic or tech power that normally costs <strong>1 action</strong> as a <strong>free action</strong>, provided that power is not on cooldown.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto a weapon in your inventory to install it. It affects only that weapon. The free-action power is yours to use.</em></p>"
